    "title": "New Vicksburg police chief shares vision - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Patrice Clark ,\n9 hours ago VICKSBURG, Miss. (WLBT) - A new era is dawning at the Vicksburg Police Department. A native of the river city, Larry Burns was appointed as the new Chief of Police on Aug. 25. Burns sat down with 3 On Your Side to delve into his reasons for taking on this challenging role in a tough law enforcement climate and his plans to address gun violence and juvenile crime. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
